(Kandal): Mr. Vongsey Visoth, Permanent Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, Deputy Chairman of the Supreme National Economic Council and Chairman of the National Working Group for Muk Kampoul District, Kandal Province, on the morning of July 17, 2020, presented a candle. Rainy days, food and suffixes are given to monks who remember the rainy season at 3 pagodas in Prek Anchanh commune, Muk Kampoul district to help support and make it easier for the monks this rainy season.
