In particular, in Muk Kampoul district, in general, and in Prek Anchanh commune, it has also achieved many achievements, such as infrastructure, national roads, bridges, roads, and many other achievements in almost all fields. Currently, Prek Anchanh area is gradually developing into a small town through a series of Borey construction projects.
