(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, President of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy, His Majesty the King, presided over the opening ceremony of the first session. 33 of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy at the Royal Palace of Khemrin, Royal Palace, which took place on the morning of July 17, 2020.
A press release from the Supreme Council of the Magistracy states that the 33rd session has seven agendas:
First, review and decide on the appointment of the President of the Court of Appeal, the transfer area and the appointment of the President and Deputy Chief Judges of the Capital and Provincial Courts.
Second: Consultation on the proposal to appoint the Deputy Prosecutor General of the Court of Appeal, the transfer area and the appointment of the Deputy Prosecutor of the Provincial Prosecutor's Office at the request of the Minister of Justice
Third: Examining and deciding on the request for permission to continue the study of a judge of Kandal Provincial Court
Fourth: Review and decide on the proposal to appoint soup as a judge for 39 interns.
Fifth: Consultation on the request to appoint Soup within the framework of the Prosecutor to 15 Deputy Interns at the request of the Minister of Justice
Sixth: Review and decide on the appointment of judges and prosecutors according to their positions
