Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh said: "All Cambodian veterans must continue to adhere to the heroism and courage to be worthy of the outstanding descendants of the motherland, even now you have become veterans must continue to maintain the spirit of heroism. "This noble tradition is to be a good example for the next generation to take turns in society."
