* Request the provincial police and police to help disseminate information about the dangers of landmines and explosive remnants of war to the community, especially the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes and the law on the control of weapons, explosives and ammunition, and conduct research And confiscated from people who take the seeds to store in the family for processing into various appliances.
