Both fishermen and authorities at all levels in Stung Hav district see the repair and installation of garages in their local area as an economic lifeblood for fishermen. Therefore, the authorities and the Royal Government at all levels should prepare this garage in accordance with the standard, which allows fishing boats and cargo boats of all kinds to come and repair easily.
