These 11 recommendations of the Minister of National Defense were made this morning, July 14, 2020, on the occasion of Samdech presiding over the celebration of the 27th anniversary of the establishment of the National Gendarmerie (14 July 1993-14 July 2020) in Phnom Penh.
The event was attended by Ministers, representatives of ministries, institutions, leaders of the Ministry of National Defense, the Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, as well as the military staff of many friendly countries.
The 11 recommendations of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh include:
* First: To monitor and grasp all the general situation and situation related to the profession, as well as to take measures to prevent and interpret in time all the information that exaggerates the facts. Strengthen internal unity and the implementation of tens of thousands of ranks of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
* Third: Care must be taken to prepare and strengthen the organizational structure in accordance with Sub-Decree No. 11 dated January 9, 2019 on the revision of the organizational structure of the National Gendarmerie Command. .
* Fourth: Continue to pay attention to education, training, training and psychological education to develop human resources, strengthen capacity, improve the quality of work responsibly and effectively.
* Fifth: Continue to pay attention to the work of raising and caring for the health of the army and continue to promote the cultivation of crops and livestock to improve the daily life of the army even better and continue to respect the guidelines of the Ministry of Health in the fight against disease. Kovid-19 to be effective.
* Sixth: Take care of all means, equipment, weapons and ammunition to prevent fire, damage, loss and use effectively in accordance with the technical specifications.
* Seventh: Efforts must be made to maintain and repair existing structures and pay attention to the construction of new structures in a technical manner to ensure quality and long-term use.
* Eighth: Continue to manage the inventory of state property, make annual land inventory and cooperate more closely with local authorities and relevant professional departments to make property certificates in each unit quickly and clearly.
9th: Continue to pay attention to the work of the policy of praise, encouragement and policy to solve difficulties for officers and deputies of the Royal Gendarmerie. Strictly follow the hierarchy of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and strive to build units.
And 11th: Participate in compiling laws and regulations to serve the people effectively according to the requests, requests and needs of daily life and desires of the people.
