(Phnom Penh): General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and Commander of the National Gendarmerie, confirmed that in the last year, the Gendarmerie has searched and cracked down on 2,837 crimes and found suspects. 4,345 people arrested 3,981 suspects and seized a lot of evidence and sent it to court.
