(Phnom Penh): The murder of a husband who brutally killed his wife without fear, including a 5-month-old baby, and then put an ax in the mouth of the body on July 13, 2020, the police force to search and arrest And at the point of concrete road, Trea village, Sangkat Steung Meanchey I, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh.
The operation took place under the direct command of Lt. Gen. Thet, Deputy Commissioner General and Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner.
After receiving the above order, Colonel Meng Vimean Dara, Meanchey District Inspector and Mr. Kim Kalyan, Deputy Inspector in charge of Criminal Planning, together with Col. Mao Savoeun, Chief of Stung Meanchey I Administrative Police Station and relevant specialized units, conducted a thorough search and investigation. Keep until the arrest of the above suspects.
The police confirmed that the assailant was her husband, Keo Vannak, alias Nak, 22 years old, unspecified occupation, living in Lot No. 1, Trea Village, Sangkat Stung Meanchey I, Khan Meanchey. The victim, Srey Pov, about 35 years old, was about 5 months pregnant and stayed at the scene.
It should be informed that this incident happened on the night of July 11, 2020. Prior to the incident, a child living near the scene described that while he was playing a mobile game at home in Trea village, Sangkat Stung Meanchey I, Khan Meanchey, suddenly heard the voice of Keo Vannak, who lives in a plot of land near his house, shouted The wife said she bit her tongue and the suspect, Keo Vannak, escaped on a bicycle.
Later, Yun Makara called his mother to find out the story and was shocked. At 8:20 pm, the police force of Stung Meanchey I Police Station arrived at the scene and found the victim sleeping. Died with an ax in his mouth and a piece of transparent tape near the body.
Later, the police of Stung Meanchey I Police Station contacted the forensic office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police and Dr. Nong Sovannaroth, the forensic doctor of Phnom Penh to inspect the body of the victim and confirmed that the body of the victim was dead. Due to suffocation caused by stuffing the mouth with an ax.
