According to the spokesperson of the General Commissioner, within 73 days of tightening the road traffic law by increasing the fine according to Sub-Decree No. 39, from May 1 to July 12, 2020, the traffic police nationwide inspected And fined a total of 100,738 vehicles, including 74,112 motorcycles and 26,626 vehicles of all types.
