(Kandal): A young drug addict destroyed property, set fire to a house, and beat a police officer at the police station in Takhmao City, Kandal Province, because he was angry with his mother for locking the house after using drugs.
The case of violence occurred on July 12, 2020 at the victim's house in Ta Kdol village, Ta Kdol commune, Takhmao city, Kandal province.
Police recounted that at the time of the incident, the suspect had already used drugs and was locked in the house by his mother, which angered the suspect, who destroyed two motorcycles and set the house on fire. All the materials are in the house.
After that, Mr. Phorn Lyko, the police officer of Ta Kdol Sangkat, opened the road to lead the fire truck of Kandal Provincial Police to help spray water, but then saw the suspect lying in the middle of the road to prevent the car from entering for fear of the car. Mr. Phorn Lyko also called the suspect to get up, but the suspect removed the belt and hit him on the left head, causing bleeding.
