Through this change of residence, Mr. Neth Pheaktra stated that it is a change to their business in a new way, by stopping deforestation, hunting, instead of planting new modern agricultural crops that can support a better life. Before. The project focuses on improving the livelihoods of 220 families who have previously been deforested by deforestation, nomadic plantations and wildlife hunting.
