With the technical assistance of the Wildlife Alliance, the villagers have acquired money management skills, modern agricultural skills, as well as established and managed community agricultural associations and warehouses that manage agricultural production, oversee agricultural production, and promote their products. Healthcare market, education, conservation of natural resources and micro-credit system.
