This statement was made by Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Environment during a visit to the patrol and prevention of illegal logging and hunting of wildlife officials in Sre Ambel district, Koh Kong province this morning. This 9th of July.
