Nephew of Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Kim Cheat donates 200 plates to the Samneang Music Association for the Disabled
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of July 8, 2020, Mr. HUN Kimcheat, the nephew of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Ms. Dana On donated kitchen utensils for the visually impaired. 200 sets of dishes used to serve food to the accommodation and vocational training center of the Samneang Music Association for the Disabled.
