Minister Veng Sakhon added that the growers have also complied with the technical specifications and signed a supply contract, which provides modern agricultural production technology such as growing vegetables in the house, using nets, drip systems and meat, using fertilizers and pesticides properly.
Minister Veng Sakhon added that all these factors are the source of safe production growth, economic efficiency, income and sustainability of the family economy.
He said that the health of family producers has been improved, the family is happy with daily life, happy family reunion, especially satisfied and supportive of the leadership of the Royal Government with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister.
