(Phnom Penh): After the past efforts of the National Bank of Cambodia to promote the use of the riel, the momentum of the use of the riel in 2019 and the first six months of 2020 has increased significantly. This is according to Mr. Chea Chanto, Governor of the National Bank of Cambodia.
Mr. Chea Chanto said in the program to summarize the work results of the first half and the work direction of the second half of 2020 of the National Bank of Cambodia on July 7, 2020, Mr. Chea Chanto said that the National Bank of Cambodia continues to manage Efficient and safe cash flow to meet the needs of people across the country.
"The use of the riel has increased significantly in 2019 and the beginning of 2020, reflected by a 36.4% increase in cash flow in circulation and an increase in the credit ratio in riel to 13% of total loans," he said. .
Mr. Chea Chanto said that in accordance with the policy to promote the use of the riel, old, torn and torn banknotes were collected and replaced with new, high-quality and high-quality riel banknotes.
(Takeo): General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, said that peace is priceless and peace is the most necessary condition for building a prosperous society. Without peace, there is no development, and without peace, there is no democracy and respect for human rights and freedom of religion.
