(Banteay Meanchey): Two men were killed by lightning in Sangkat Teuk Thla, Serey Sophorn City, Banteay Meanchey Province. This incident happened on the evening of July 6, 2020 at 17:00.
According to the report, before the incident, there was rain mixed with strong wind, thunder and lightning, and suddenly two men were shot at the plot of land.
The first victim: 34-year-old Seak Ji Chow, resident of Keab village, Sangkat Teuk Thla, Serey Sophorn city, and the second victim: Yang Ly, 33 years old, resident of village 4, Sangkat Preah Ponlea, Serey Sophorn city, Banteay Meanchey province.
The body is now being taken to relatives for a traditional ceremony at home.
Announcing the appointment of Prey Veng Provincial Branch Customs and Excise Director, Mr. Muong Dara, to replace Mr. Kaing Leang, who transferred to Siem Reap Provincial Customs Branch Chief
(Prey Veng): Prey Veng Provincial Governor Chea Somethy urged customs and excise officials in their jurisdiction to work hard to prevent all forms of tax evasion and help prevent counterfeit products because counterfeit products are double-edged swords. To affect the health of all of us.
Mr. Chea Somethy made this statement during the announcement of the appointment of Mr. Muong Dara as the Head of Prey Veng Provincial Customs and Excise Office to replace Mr. Kaing Leang on the evening of July 6, 2020 at the Provincial Customs and Excise Hall. .
In addition, efforts must be made to effectively prevent tax evasion with professional ethics as a Cambodian Customs and Excise official in a spirit of high responsibility, in order to maintain good internal and external solidarity.
This promotion and promotion is an additional honor in accordance with the trust of the management and also a burden of additional workload, which requires constant respect for the motherland, the Royal Government. Ministry of Economy and Finance and General Department of Customs and Excise of Cambodia. Mr. Nuon Chanrith added.
He said that all efforts must be made to implement the unit's mission in accordance with the vision and basic values set out in the customs reform and modernization strategy and in line with other relevant policies and visions of the organization. The Royal Government of Cambodia as well.
He praised and thanked Customs and Excise officials at all levels as colleagues throughout the country who have contributed to and successfully implemented the main mission of his unit is revenue collection, trade facilitation and combat. Cross-border crimes, especially smuggled goods. The Ministry of Agriculture issued a decision to establish a working group to research and verify data on forest land that people actually enjoy.
