Celebrating the 12th Anniversary of Preah Vihear Temple Listed as a World Heritage Site! General Professor Chea Dara leads the military to plant trees
(Phnom Penh): On July 7, 2020, General Professor Chea Dara, Personal Adviser to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia in charge of the Rector of the National Defense University, led the planting of more than 200 rosewood trees at the National Defense University. With the participation of many senior military students, defense officers, commanders, and undergraduates.
"July 7 is the day of the greatest pride of the Khmer nation, the day of the inscription of the Temple of Preah Vihear on the World Heritage List, making the world recognize that Cambodia is the owner of the Temple of Preah Vihear and the culture and architecture that exists," he said. More than 1,000 years old on the top of Dangrek Mountain has become a world heritage site that is highly valued, making the world know that Khmer heritage is a Cambodian treasure and has become a world treasure. .
Please be reminded that the World Heritage Committee has unanimously decided to include the temple of Preah Vihear, a Khmer architecture built during the Angkorian period, at the southern end of the 625-meter-high cliffs of Phnom Preah Vihear on the Dangrek Mountains, in the World Heritage List. With universal value under Resolution 32 COM 8B.102.
One week later, on July 14, 2008, a celebration was held at the National Stadium. The event further strengthened the overall national unity under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who raised national pride through our achievements.
Cambodia must defend its territorial integrity, no matter how much it is sacrificed, but the whole nation has the discretion to leave this issue to the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister.
On July 16, 2008, Samdech Techo issued an effective order for the army to maintain absolute patience, not to explode weapons, everything must be resolved through negotiations, but not to lose land. This order was successfully implemented by our commander until the general election on July 27, 2008 went smoothly, the people voted for the CPP.
On August 1, 2008, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen prayed for peace on the Preah Vihear temple through a crowd of Thai soldiers at Wat Ke Sikkha Kirisvara. This brave heroism has made our forces more motivated to increase their will to defend their land.
National Defense Strengthens Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Provides Construction of Infrastructure, Bridges, Roads, Provides Armed Forces with Full Capacity, Combat Capacity As an army development village at the foot of Dangrek mountain, the border area provides rice and provides means for the families of the army to grow crops.
The presence of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit in the area of Preah Vihear Temple from 6 to 10 February 2010 to inaugurate achievements and visit made the army more stable, expand the will to fight and dare to make all kinds of sacrifices .
The things that bring victory in the area of the Temple of Preah Vihear that we have achieved to this day are:
* First: Khmer people during the Samdech Techo era are now united as one, building a patriotic movement under one umbrella, the leadership of the Royal Government comes from the election, comes from the real will of the people.
* Second: We have Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, who has supported the army, families, soldiers and people along the border, new homes, roads, labyrinths, schools and hospitals. Many pagodas, especially villages for the development of military families along the border, make the army more stable. In the rainy season, Samdech provides raincoats, in winter, Samdech provides winter coats.
* Third: The front line army is willing to fight bravely, exercise the right to defend its territory like a guard, in accordance with the words of Samdech Techo, we do not want even a millimeter of Thai land, but also do not allow them to invade We are even a millimeter.
* Fourth: We have the support of the King, the Senate, the National Assembly, all ministries, government agencies, local authorities, Preah Vihear province, private companies, allied units that have helped to create a strong army, especially participation. Support from Cambodians of all walks of life.
* Fifth: We have received attention in guiding and guiding the timely implementation of the plan from Samdech Pichey Sena, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of National Defense, creating conditions for internal unity, good cooperation between the army and The army between the army and the national police force, which is a good tradition.
Overall, the success we have achieved is due to the joint implementation of a single regulation, the effective regulation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister on the right to territorial defense of Cambodia.
CALIFORNIA (Reuters) - Scientists from universities in the United States and the United Kingdom have released a new study that explains why the Earth's crust is at a depth of 2,800 kilometers. Can cause the Earth's magnetic field to change up to 10 times faster than previously thought. This is according to the release by Sky News on Tuesday morning, July 7, 2020.
Although the study of changes in the Earth's magnetic field has only been done via satellite, scientists have recently found many results. The shocking result is that the Earth's magnetic field has lost about 10% of its influence on average over the last 200 years, and we can estimate this through the weakest regions. South Atlantic Ocean between South America and Africa.
However, for the faster magnetic field changes in the last 400 years, scientists have not yet had an explanation, as studies are continuing, especially on the motion of the Earth's core. Which is the most important driving force of the generation of magnetic force.
