(Phnom Penh): Senior Minister Chhay Thorn, Minister of Planning, on the afternoon of July 6, 2020, chaired a meeting with Capital, Provincial and Municipal Planning Departments throughout the country to reflect on the implementation of procedures for identifying poor families as requested during When Kovid spread 19. The meeting was held at the Ministry of Planning.
The meeting will also look at the irregularities in the provision of equity cards to poor families and the introduction of measures such as:
