Sala Visay commune has 19 villages, 3,120 families with a total population of 16,660 people, 7,888 females, of which 945 families were interviewed and received equity cards from the Royal Government as well as the Ministry of Planning. 425 poor families and 520 poor families, including 1 poor and 2 poor families with a total of 4,440 members, 2220 females. So far, the distribution of equity cards and cash to 800 families.
