Mr. Kouch Chamnan, Chairman of Chbar Ampov Market Commission, said that the third phase of the market roof construction project has started gradually. Now, the team has prepared to dismantle the old stall and remove all the debris to speed up the construction.
Vendors' stalls that need to be temporarily relocated to make it easier for the team to build the roof of the market, there are 300 stalls, after construction, the team will arrange all 300 stalls in good order so that the stall owners can return to normal trading.
Please be reminded that Chbar Ampov Market caught fire in the middle of midnight in March 2019, causing more than 500 stalls to burn completely, all kinds of goods worth tens of thousands of dollars, after the team of Phnom Penh Capital Hall and the school Chbar Ampov district has started to rebuild the market and set up stalls, organize the power grid system and arrange the drainage system to be clogged.
