The announcement was made at a press conference on progress, challenges, irregularities and protests over the implementation of the cash assistance program for the poor and vulnerable during the fight against Kovid 19. Ministry of Social Affairs on July 2, 2020.
The Minister of Social Affairs said that because the Ministry of Social Affairs did not have the authority to enforce the law on any local official who violated such principles, the Ministry issued an official letter to the Ministry of Interior.
