In addition to consumer goods and food, Cambodians also donate rain to the monks, because we believe that the light of the candle is to brighten the future of the nation to be bright, beautiful and prosperous by good deeds, goodness, and they must keep the candle light Burn for three months. In addition, this helps the pagoda to have candles used to light at night as well.
