(Prey Veng): Officials from the Production and Veterinary Office of the Prey Veng Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries distributed disinfectants to farmers raising ducks, laying eggs and inspecting the duck production chain from hatching to selling eggs in Prey Pnov commune. Pea, Prey Veng province.
