(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, stated that the new building of the Ministry of National Defense is a model that will continue to move forward as a building to serve the national defense strategy. Efforts must be made to build a strong and durable, because the defense sector has contributed significantly to maintaining peace for the motherland.
This morning, June 30, 2020, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh said this on the occasion that Samdech led a delegation with the participation of General Vong Pisen, Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, as well as the construction team of the Department of Engineering, Ministry of Defense. The National Inspectorate inspected the progress of the construction process of the new Ministry of National Defense building located at the old Ministry of National Defense.
