The Great Architecture was built by King Long Chou as Emperor Kublai Khan, covering an area of 720,000 square meters.
This magnificent palace has an important entrance called the "Gate of Heaven", but before entering the sacred gate, one must first pass through a large rectangular square used for military training.
In addition, there are trenches in tiers and a marble bridge leading to the Royal Palace through another large gate called the "Central Gate". Then there is the courtyard in front of the courtyard, crossing to another water tower called "Kasinthum Meas", the entrance to the inner court, and then there is a large inner palace for the king to leave. Come to oversee the royal affairs.
Outside the southern part of the Xi Jinqing Palace, or Forbidden City, there is a shrine dedicated to the deity, separated by a wall, as well as several large pagodas, such as the Temple of Heaven, with a magnificent three-story tower with a 27-story roof. 43 meters and is considered a religious monument.
Dr. Sok Touch made this request at a press conference on "Progress of the National Council for the Khmer Language of the Royal Academy of Cambodia" on the morning of June 30, 2020.
During the conference, Dr. Sok Touch noted that some ministries and institutions, when creating new words to use in their field, did not pass without consulting with the Royal Academy of Cambodia and the National Council for the Khmer Language. When put into use, some members of the public do not understand the new word until it is criticized by the people as well.
Dr. Sok Touch said that scientists do not have all the intuition, scientists need to think, need to know, need to see first. So as new science advances, so do new words.
In order to avoid using the wrong words and people do not understand, Mr. Sok Touch asked all institutions before sending anything to send to the National Council for the Khmer language to know the easy words and explain to the public the question to the Royal Academy .
In this conference, Dr. Sok Touch also thanked Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment, who always uses language to discuss and consult with the Royal Academy of Cambodia before issuing new words. At the same time, Mr. Sok Touch directly criticized Senior Minister Cham Prasidh, never discussing with the Royal Academy of Cambodia when issuing new words.
In this morning's conference, Dr. Hean Sokhom, President of the National Council for the Khmer Language, also confirmed the history and role of the National Council for the Khmer Language. Mr. Hean Sokhom stated that the National Council for the Khmer Language was established in 2011 following the National Committee for the Khmer Language, which was established in 2007 and became an annexed institution of the Royal Academy of Cambodia in 2017.
He added that the National Council for the Khmer Language has the main role and task of preserving and developing the sustainable use of the Khmer language and script, as well as maintaining the Khmer national identity and reviewing and approving the technology proposed by the 17 technical committees. Approve other technical terms proposed by ministries and institutions as well as organize workshops to seek approval for the use of the Khmer language, etc.
The National Council for the Khmer Language has also published books on Khmer grammar, number systems, and other achievements. In the year 2020, CPPCC Will continue to publish a bulletin, two glossaries, a glossary of literature, a glossary of chemistry and physics, and a national policy book on the Khmer language.
Speaking in an interview with Fresh News TV, the doctor confirmed that the Ministry of Health's measures to make a catastrophe, many people have questions to our health sector, why not take a cataclysm for two or three days or 5 days is necessary to do up to 14 days like this.
