Sources from the traders said that in the past, they sold out because live pigs were cheap, there were many buyers who ate a lot of meat a day, cut three to four heads, never sold the rest, but later, at the same time as the outbreak of Kovid 19 The price of pork is still high, sometimes one day in the evening, one pig is not sold out.
The pork sellers confirmed that now the pork is not sold every day, but the live pigs are brought by traders to raise the price every day and can not sell anymore, what should they think? While the price of live pigs bought up to 14,500 riel per kilogram, in the past, the price of live pigs was only 9,000 riel or 10,000 riel. For the current market, pure meat sells for only 18,000 riel to 20 000 Riel per kilogram only.
