Mr. Steng Sokhom: Salvation, protection and development of the nation and the people are the outstanding values of the Cambodian People's Party
During the celebration of the 69th anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party on June 28, 2020 at the CPP headquarters in Kamchay Mear district, Prey Veng province, Mr. Steng Sokhom said, "The rescue, defense and development of the nation and people. "People are the outstanding values of the Cambodian People's Party" which no other party in Cambodia can do that is a historical truth that no one can come and destroy.
After 1979, even though the nation was liberated, the Khmer Rouge regime destroyed the roots of our nation's economy and vital infrastructure, starting from scratch and being unjustly economically sanctioned. Died of lack of food.
