He confirmed that two 19 Kovid patients had been found in Preah Vihear province, but had already been treated by provincial doctors. Until now, there are no cases of this disease in Preah Vihear province. Found the first company to successfully register a business through the information technology system of the Royal Government
(Phnom Penh): Inheidation Corporation (Cambodia) Co., Ltd. became the first company to successfully register a business through the Royal Government's information technology system.
Please be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia this morning, June 15, 2020, officially announced the launch of the business registration system for information technology nursery (online system).
This information technology business registration system is a new pillar of the sharp reform of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, in order to enhance the competitiveness and improve the investment environment in Cambodia.
This new business registration system and mechanism is the first system of the Royal Government that has an exchange of data with the information technology system of the relevant ministries and institutions within the framework of the ecosystem, which has been implemented inter-ministerially by the data. All will be automatically shared to the information technology system of the relevant ministries and institutions for review and approval.
Proceedings in registration, filing of references, as well as the recovery of business registration certificates, tax registration certificates, patents, as well as all other documents will be provided and received in digital form which will Made entirely in the information technology nursery and no longer used as a tangible document in hard form.
Through this information technology nursery, complex procedures, repeated and repetitive information, the time and expense incurred during the stages of business registration within the old mechanism framework are minimized.
In addition, the new business registration system will also provide an important opportunity for businesses seeking legal documents to identify their businesses in order to accelerate and obtain credit from the Royal Government's special financing program in support of the sector. Private affected by the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
The official launch of the Information Technology Nursery Business Registration System is now just the first phase, focusing on new business registrations. In the next phase, the Royal Government will continue to expand the scope of this system to cover all other ministries and institutions to organize the licensing of information technology nurseries.
