Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Leaders of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) Celebrate the Blessing Ceremony of the Party Headquarters (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): That glorious era of development has been completed and the Blessing Blessing Ceremony will be officially launched on the afternoon of June 28, 2020.
The inauguration ceremony of the new headquarters of the party leading the Royal Government of Cambodia was held at the invitation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and many other senior leaders of the Cambodian People's Party. .
The new building of the CPP headquarters was laid on November 11, 2018 and will be completed in June 2020. The new presence of the CPP headquarters will be an important venue of the CPP, the party that is leading the Royal Government and highly responsible for the fate of the nation and the people of Cambodia.
The building is 150 meters long and 74 meters wide. The height of the building from the front public square to the top of the diamond is 48 meters. The ground floor has more than 500 parking spaces and a front yard for public parking for 300 cars. Upstairs is a public meeting hall for about 10,000 people.
The five-story building has a 3,000-square-meter lobby that can seat more than 4,000 people, and a cafeteria on the south side that can seat 120 people at a time.
The building has an audiovisual room, a barber room, an administration room, a room for the disabled, a warehouse room, a room for the guards, a meeting room for the Standing Committee, and an international meeting room. As a permanent member hall and dining room. The building also has a dining hall for 150 people and a dining room.
The CPP headquarters building was built with fine Khmer style and elegance. From the outside, the whole building is highlighted in white, a symbol of sincerity for the nation and its people.
The building's architect points out that the building was built in a new style called contemporary style because of the combination of three styles. The three styles are: 1) Angkor Wat style, 2) Banteay Srei style and 3) Kandal style. The combination of these three styles is called "contemporary style".
The sublime and beautiful presence of the CPP headquarters building is highlighted on the occasion of the 69th anniversary of the CPP.
The Cambodian People's Party was founded on June 28, 1951. This party has become a political party that has fulfilled its mission very actively to bring benefits to the Cambodian nation.
Since its inception, the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) has always adhered to its goals and ideals, standing by the people, connecting with the people, overcoming all obstacles, daring to make unremitting sacrifices for an independent Cambodia, peace, freedom, democracy, neutrality and social progress. .
In the face of the genocidal catastrophe that the Democratic Kampuchea regime caused since April 1975, the CPP was the only political force that stood up and rallied all the patriotic forces created. Rise up the Cambodian National Salvation Front to inspire and lead the people's movement throughout the country to overthrow this vicious regime.
Since the overthrow of the genocidal regime, the Cambodian People's Party, led by Samdech Thamma Porsal Chea Sim, Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin and Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has brought back the people their rights, freedoms, democracy, honor and dignity. The dignity of the people was completely lost during the Democratic Kampuchea regime.
In addition, the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) has been a key force in the process of national unification until the Paris Agreement on the Political Solution of Cambodia on October 23, 1991, and is an indispensable support force in its implementation. Successfully reached an agreement leading to the establishment of a new monarchy.
The second monarchy, led by the Royal Government, emerged from the Cambodian People's Party, strived to unite the nation, lead, restore and rebuild the social economy from zero, reviving and stabilizing all sectors step by step, creating a precedent. The basis for the restoration and development of the country should be proud to this day.
The CPP headquarters building, which stands out in the center of Phnom Penh, is a reflection of the power as well as the greatness of the Cambodian People's Party in leading to achieve great achievements that should be a source of pride for the nation and the people of Cambodia. Since the liberation of the country from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot on January 7, 1979.
The majestic presence of the building is also a demonstration of the strength and symbol of the great unity and prosperity of the Cambodian People's Party, which is an indispensable reference for the nation and the people of Cambodia from the past to the present and to The future. Mr. Dy Pov and Mr. Seang Bunleang, Mother of Preah Vossa Candle Parade to Wat Kdei Lvea in Trapeang Kong Commune, Samrong Tong District, Kampong Speu Province
