In this partnership, Wing Specialized Bank will support Smile Cambodia to promote free surgery to Cambodian patients with cleft lip, cleft palate and other facial deformities through Wing Specialized Bank's communication system. Including: social media, websites, Wing smartphone apps and through Wing agents.
As one of the leading specialized banks in Cambodia, Wing has also instilled a spirit of social participation in employees and their day-to-day business operations. Wing is committed to making Cambodia better by all means. That is why Wing's CSR program focuses on: literacy, finance, health and safety, community development, education, as well as strengthening gender equality.
Patients with cleft lip and palate are reluctant to socialize, which can lead to psychological and behavioral problems. Since 2015, Smile Cambodia has been strongly committed to continuing the valuable cause of providing free surgery to Cambodian patients with cleft lip, cleft palate and other facial deformities.
From now on, nearly 8,000 Wing agents across the Kingdom will be involved in providing the light of life to children throughout the Kingdom of Cambodia.
