In 2019, Cambodia received more than 11 million air arrivals and departures with nearly 80,000 tons. In response to the growing number of passengers and air transport and to expand its flights to the world, the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has been building several international airports. More.
The new Phnom Penh International Airport, located in Kandal Steung District, Saang District, Kandal Province and Bati District, Takeo Province, is one of Cambodia's new international airports that will replace Cambodia's current Phnom Penh International Airport in receiving passengers from around the world. .
After signing the project under the chairmanship of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Chinese Premier Li Keqiang in 2018, the international airport to show the power of aviation in Cambodia has been busy under construction.
In an interview with Fresh News, Sang Haifeng, construction project manager of China Construction Engineering Co., Ltd., expressed his pleasure at being awarded the right to build an international airport, one of the largest in Cambodia.
The new airport will be built on an area of about 2,600 hectares, with a length of 6.2 km and a width of 4.2 km. Cambodia's new international airport, which is scheduled to be completed in the first phase in 2023, will cost about $ 1.5 billion.
Designed by Foster & Partners of the United Kingdom, combined with the fancy style that is the identity of Cambodia will make the international airport even more luxurious. The airport will also be equipped with more advanced technology to make it easier for passengers to get in and out.
The airport will have different lanes for departures and departures, and there will be different parking divisions between special guests, national and world leaders, and general passengers.
Evaluating the design and layout of various technologies, including the large construction area, Sang Haifeng considers the airport to be one of the top airports in Southeast Asia. He claimed that the airport is ranked No. 1 or No. 2 among the most famous airports in Southeast Asia.
"The new Phnom Penh International Airport, which is luxuriously designed, has a very beautiful appearance and is in line with the culture of Cambodia," he said. To date, the new Phnom Penh International Airport project is one of the largest airport projects in the ASEAN region. "Once completed, it will be an important gateway to the region as well."
"The new Phnom Penh International Airport will be one of the largest international airports in Southeast Asia because of its large capacity," he said. The work of the third Chinese engineering construction company in China, including the speed of work and quality, has been very well received. We are very confident in building a new Phnom Penh International Airport project with good quality.
With the opportunity to build a large construction site in Cambodia for the first time, a third Chinese engineering construction company is determined to achieve the planned construction of this international airport with international quality standards.
"I think everyone, including me and my colleagues, is honored and happy to be involved in the construction of this new Phnom Penh International Airport project. We will be here to build an international airport," he said. "Excellent quality."
